        "name": "USN-7695-1",
        "description": "Anas Roubi discovered that Sidekiq did not correctly sanitize certain inputs. An attacker could possibly use this issue to execute a cross-site scripting (XSS) attack. This issue only affected Ubuntu 18.04 LTS, and Ubuntu 20.04 LTS. (CVE-2021-30151)  It was discovered that Sidekiq did not correctly bound certain inputs. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2022-23837)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2021-30151",
          "CVE-2022-23837"
        ]
